{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>港姐季軍梁超怡（Joey）日前（12日）迎來 30 歲生日，獲一班好友用心舉辦溫馨生日派對慶祝，Joey 在社交平台晒出一輯靚相並直言：「被滿滿的愛包圍，覺得好幸運」！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4ba6ae7b82b7dd33-602\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中所見，現場以粉白氣球佈置，充滿少女心，枱上擺滿多個精緻的生日蛋糕以及巨型玫瑰花束。身穿淡黃色吊帶晚裝的 Joey 對鏡甜派心心，大晒長腿及鎖骨。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_4ba6ae7b82b7dd33-602\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b1d7b867-e394-4d1b-a1a0-1c8cc91cb08b.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202658VUz3OpgB1789958979.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b1d7b867-e394-4d1b-a1a0-1c8cc91cb08b.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4ba6ae7b82b7dd33-603\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>不過最特別的，莫過於現場出現內地男星劉宇寧的人形紙牌，紙牌上的劉宇寧身穿型格黑西裝配黑超，手持印有「生日快樂」的扇子，Joey 則秒變小粉絲，興奮與偶像紙牌合影。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_4ba6ae7b82b7dd33-603\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e693b3f3-19c5-4c92-9dbe-3a118e4ce146.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026R74blrGbDB1789958979.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e693b3f3-19c5-4c92-9dbe-3a118e4ce146.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4ba6ae7b82b7dd33-604\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>正式踏入 3 字頭，Joey 亦感性發文：「年齡只是個數字，我的人生才剛開始。期待更多的冒險、成長，以及更多精彩的一切。盡情享受美好生活的點點滴滴。感恩有你們。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T03:20:01.367032+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}